# Necessary exceptions. redteam/ attack fixtures are excluded via skip-dirs on
# the trivy-action, not here. Each id below is a documented, required deviation
# on a specific workload; keep this list tight and re-triage on any bump.

# terraform/modules/vpc/main.tf: public subnets host the internet-facing NLB and
# NAT gateways, which require auto-assigned public IPs. Private subnets do not.
AWS-0164

# terraform/modules/platform/policies/cspm/kube-bench-job.yaml: kube-bench reads
# kubelet config and process args off the host, so it needs hostPID, a writable
# root fs, and root. It cannot satisfy the restricted PodSecurity baseline; that
# is the whole point of running it. See the header comment in that manifest.
KSV-0010
KSV-0014
KSV-0118
